butionPackage":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersions/fbf98057-6537-413c-ae71-4812a7cf1bbc/relationships/alternativeDistributionPackage","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersions/fbf98057-6537-413c-ae71-4812a7cf1bbc/alternativeDistributionPackage"}}},"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersions/fbf98057-6537-413c-ae71-4812a7cf1bbc"}}],"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/apps/6759662867/appStoreVersions?filter%5BversionString%5D=1.0.3\u0026filter%5Bplatform%5D=IOS\u0026include=appStoreVersionLocalizations%2Cbuild"},"included":[{"attributes":{"description":"KeepFit（管住嘴迈开腿）是一款专注于饮食记录、运动记录与热量平衡管理的 iPhone / iPad 应用。\n\n你可以：\n• 记录每日饮食，自动换算热量与营养结构\n• 记录锻炼项目、时长与运动消耗\n• 结合基础代谢、日常活动与运动数据，查看每日赤字或超量\n• 通过周历、月历与长期趋势图，观察体重、体脂与热量变化\n• 按需连接 Apple 健康与 iCloud，同步你的相关数据\n• 自定义主题、语言、单位、提醒与个人目标\n\n主要功能：\n• 饮食记录：食物库、重量换算、热量与营养结构分析\n• 运动记录：常见运动项目库、时长记录、热量消耗估算\n• 综合热量：查看每日摄入、消耗与赤字/超量情况\n• 长期趋势：热量、体重、体脂趋势图\n• Apple 健康：可选同步体重、体脂、运动与饮食相关数据\n• iCloud：可选同步数据与常用设置\n• Apple 账号：支持 Sign in with Apple，也支持本地使用模式\n\nKeepFit 帮你更清晰地看见每天的摄入、消耗与变化，让饮食控制和减脂管理更简单。","keywords":"减脂,热量,卡路里,饮食记录,运动记录,体重,体脂,健康,健身,Apple健康","locale":"zh-Hans","marketingUrl":null,"promotionalText":"KeepFit 帮你轻松记录饮食、运动与热量平衡，用更清晰的数据看见每天的摄入、消耗与变化。","supportUrl":"https://larryhu1988.github.io/KeepFit/support/","whatsNew":"1. 优化“为 KeepFit 评分”入口，点击后可更稳定地跳转到 App Store 评分页面。\n2. 修复 Apple 账号登录后部分设置、头像和数据在重新打开 App 后可能回退的问题，提升同步稳定性。\n3. 优化“分享 APP”功能，现在会分享 KeepFit 的正式 App Store 链接和对应介绍文案。"},"id":"ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3","links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3"},"relationships":{"appScreenshotSets":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/relationships/appScreenshotSets","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/appScreenshotSets"}},"appPreviewSets":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/relationships/appPreviewSets","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/appPreviewSets"}},"searchKeywords":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/relationships/searchKeywords","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/searchKeywords"}},"placements":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/relationships/placements","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ecfd3aa6-07be-4cde-86d8-32bc8ec4afc3/placements"}}},"type":"appStoreVersionLocalizations"},{"attributes":{"description":"KeepFit is an iPhone and iPad app for food logging, workout tracking, and calorie balance management.\n\nWith KeepFit, you can:\n• log meals and automatically calculate calories and nutrition breakdown\n• log workouts, duration, and calories burned\n• combine BMR, daily activity, and exercise to see daily deficit or surplus\n• review weekly, monthly, and long-term trends for weight, body fat, and calories\n• optionally connect Apple Health and iCloud to sync related data\n• customize theme, language, units, reminders, and personal goals\n\nMain features:\n• Food logging: built-in food library, portion-based calorie calculation, and nutrition breakdown\n• Workout logging: common exercise library, duration tracking, and calorie burn estimates\n• Calorie balance: view daily intake, burn, and deficit/surplus at a glance\n• Long-term trends: calorie, weight, and body-fat trend charts\n• Apple Health: optionally sync weight, body fat, workouts, and dietary data\n• iCloud: optionally sync data and settings across devices\n• Apple Account: supports Sign in with Apple, while local mode is also available\n\nKeepFit helps you clearly understand what you eat, what you burn, and how your body changes over time.","keywords":"calorie,food log,workout,weight,body fat,fitness,health,diet,deficit,apple health","locale":"en-US","marketingUrl":null,"promotionalText":"KeepFit helps you track food, workouts, and calorie balance with a clearer view of your daily intake, burn, and progress.","supportUrl":"https://larryhu1988.github.io/KeepFit/support/","whatsNew":"1. Improved the “Rate KeepFit” entry so it opens the App Store rating page more reliably.\n2. Fixed an issue where some settings, avatar, or data could revert after signing in with Apple and reopening the app, improving sync reliability.\n3. Improved the “Share App” action so it now shares the official App Store link and app description."},"id":"644da542-5ae0-48d5-9851-6738efc93e57","links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/644da542-5ae0-48d5-9851-6738efc93e57"},"relationships":{"appScreenshotSets":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/644da542-5ae0-48d5-9851-6738efc93e57/relationships/appScreenshotSets","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/644da542-5ae0-48d5-9851-6738efc93e57/appScreenshotSets"}},"appPreviewSets":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/644da542-5ae0-48d5-9851-6738efc93e57/relationships/appPreviewSets","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/644da542-5ae0-48d5-9851-6738efc93e57/appPreviewSets"}},"searchKeywords":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/644da542-5ae0-48d5-9851-6738efc93e57/relationships/searchKeywords","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLo